#: ../../Residuals/Residuals_Generation_and_Management.rst:329
msgid "Equation :eq:`residuals_aluminum_mass_fraction` estimates aluminum added by the coagulant, not aluminum naturally present in clay, silt, or other source-water solids. It also excludes dissolved aluminum that does not precipitate. The corresponding aluminum-hydroxide mass fraction is :math:`Y_{\\mathrm{Al}}w_{\\mathrm{Al,res}}`. Site-specific residuals characterization should be used when total aluminum concentration or disposal suitability must be established. The estimate applies to both clarifier purges and filter backwash."
msgstr ""

